    "_%n picture or video of your posts could not be copied here._::_%n pictures or videos of your posts could not be copied here._" : ["No s'ha puesto copiar aquí %n imachen u video d'as tuyas publicacions.","No s'han puesto copiar aquí %n imachens u videos d'as tuyas publicacions."],
    "_%n picture or video of your posts could not be copied here. Your account is pointed at this server without it: the posts that show it lose it, and it is not copied later._::_%n pictures or videos of your posts could not be copied here. Your account is pointed at this server without them: the posts that show them lose them, and they are not copied later._" : ["No s'ha puesto copiar aquí %n imachen u video d'as tuyas publicacions. A tuya cuenta s'endreza ta iste servidor sin ell: as publicacions que l'amuestran lo pierden, y no se copia mas tarde.","No s'han puesto copiar aquí %n imachens u videos d'as tuyas publicacions. A tuya cuenta s'endreza ta iste servidor sin ells: as publicacions que los amuestran los pierden, y no se copian mas tarde."],
