    "Move your Bluesky account away" : "Trasladar a tuya cuenta de Bluesky",
    "Your Bluesky account can live on another server (a PDS). Your followers, posts and handle history move with it; your Fediverse account here stays as it is. Afterwards this server no longer publishes to Bluesky for you." : "A tuya cuenta de Bluesky puede estar en un atro servidor (un PDS). Os tuyos seguidors, publicacions y historial d'identificadors se trasladan con ella; a tuya cuenta d'o Fediverse d'aquí se queda como ye. Dimpués, iste servidor ya no publica en Bluesky por tu.",
    "Your Bluesky account now lives on {pds} as {handle}." : "A tuya cuenta de Bluesky agora ye en {pds} como {handle}.",
    "You, with your recovery phrase, and {host} control it now. This server no longer does." : "Tu, con a tuya frase de recuperación, y {host} la controlatz agora. Iste servidor ya no.",
    "Only {host} controls it now. This server no longer does." : "Agora nomás {host} la controla. Iste servidor ya no.",
