    "Afterwards, post where my Bluesky account went" : "Dimpués, publicar an ha iu a mía cuenta de Bluesky",
    "Your Bluesky account is moved to {server}. This cannot be undone from here." : "A tuya cuenta de Bluesky se traslada ta {server}. Isto no se puede desfer dende aquí.",
    "You have no recovery phrase: afterwards only {server} controls your Bluesky account." : "No tiens frase de recuperación: dimpués nomás {server} controlará a tuya cuenta de Bluesky.",
    "Move it" : "Trasladar-la",
    "Not now" : "Agora no",
    "Move my Bluesky account" : "Trasladar a mía cuenta de Bluesky",
    "_{n} picture or video did not arrive on {pds}. Your account still points here._::_{n} pictures or videos did not arrive on {pds}. Your account still points here._" : ["{n} imachen u video no ha plegau a {pds}. A tuya cuenta encara s'endreza ta aquí.","{n} imachens u videos no han plegau a {pds}. A tuya cuenta encara s'endreza ta aquí."],
    "_{n} picture or video did not arrive on {pds}. Your account is pointed at {pds} without it: the posts that show it lose it there, and it is not copied later._::_{n} pictures or videos did not arrive on {pds}. Your account is pointed at {pds} without them: the posts that show them lose them there, and they are not copied later._" : ["{n} imachen u video no ha plegau a {pds}. A tuya cuenta s'endreza ta {pds} sin ell: as publicacions que l'amuestran lo pierden allí, y no se copia mas tarde.","{n} imachens u videos no han plegau a {pds}. A tuya cuenta s'endreza ta {pds} sin ells: as publicacions que los amuestran los pierden allí, y no se copian mas tarde."],
