    "Bring my Bluesky account here" : "Portar aquí a mía cuenta de Bluesky",
    "_%n post you wrote here was taken off Bluesky by the move. It can be published again from your moved account._::_%n posts you wrote here were taken off Bluesky by the move. They can be published again from your moved account._" : ["O trasllado ha sacau de Bluesky %n publicación que escribiés aquí. Se puede tornar a publicar dende a tuya cuenta trasladada.","O trasllado ha sacau de Bluesky %n publicacions que escribiés aquí. Se pueden tornar a publicar dende a tuya cuenta trasladada."],
    "_%n post disappears from Bluesky; you can publish it again afterwards._::_%n posts disappear from Bluesky; you can publish them again afterwards._" : ["%n publicación desapareix de Bluesky; dimpués la puetz tornar a publicar.","%n publicacions desapareixen de Bluesky; dimpués las puetz tornar a publicar."],
    "Waiting for Bridgy Fed to start" : "Asperando que Bridgy Fed empecipie",
