    "Server" : "Servidor",
    "Handle" : "Identificador",
    "E-mail address" : "Adreza de correu electronico",
    "Password and invite code" : "Clau y codigo d'invitación",
    "The code is shown only now, works once, and only for this account." : "O codigo s'amuestra nomás agora, funciona una vegada, y nomás ta ista cuenta.",
    "Bridgy Fed bridges your account to Bluesky as {handle}. That account can live here instead: its followers on Bluesky come along, and Bridgy Fed stops bridging you, since this server reaches Bluesky itself." : "Bridgy Fed vincula a tuya cuenta con Bluesky como {handle}. Ixa cuenta puede estar aquí: os suyos seguidors en Bluesky vienen con ella, y Bridgy Fed deixa de vincular-te, ya que iste servidor aconsigue Bluesky por ell mesmo.",
    "Your account sends Bridgy Fed a direct message asking it to move {twin} here. It replaces {handle}, the Bluesky account this server made for you: that one's posts and followers are not kept." : "A tuya cuenta ninvia a Bridgy Fed un mensache directo demandando-le que traslade {twin} aquí. Reemplaza {handle}, a cuenta de Bluesky que iste servidor te fació: as publicacions y seguidors d'ixa no se conservan.",
    "Ask Bridgy Fed" : "Demandar-lo a Bridgy Fed",
    "A Bluesky account that Bridgy Fed or a migration tool moves can live on this server. Name it, and the server answers what the tool needs." : "Una cuenta de Bluesky que Bridgy Fed u una ferramienta de migración trasladan puede estar en iste servidor. Nombra-la, y o servidor responde lo que amenista a ferramienta.",
    "Gave your bridged account a domain of your own as its handle? Bluesky's search is asked for your Fediverse address to find it." : "Has dau a la tuya cuenta vinculada un dominio propio como identificador? Se demanda a la busca de Bluesky a tuya adreza d'o Fediverse ta trobar-la.",
    "No account bridged by Bridgy Fed names your Fediverse account." : "Garra cuenta vinculada por Bridgy Fed no nombra a tuya cuenta d'o Fediverse.",
    "Look for my bridged account on Bluesky" : "Buscar a mía cuenta vinculada en Bluesky",
    "Another account, with a migration tool" : "Un atra cuenta, con una ferramienta de migración",
    "The Bluesky handle or DID to move here" : "L'identificador u DID de Bluesky que cal trasladar aquí",
    "The account you move here replaces {handle}, the Bluesky account this server made for you: that one's posts and followers are not kept." : "A cuenta que trasladas aquí reemplaza {handle}, a cuenta de Bluesky que iste servidor te fació: as publicacions y seguidors d'ixa no se conservan.",
    "Invite it" : "Convidar-la",
