    "Post, like, follow and read as you" : "Publicar, dar me fa goyo, seguir y leyer como tu",
    "Know who you are" : "Saber qui yes",
    "Could not sign the app out" : "No s'ha puesto zarrar a sesión de l'aplicación",
    "Could not change whether your blocks are published" : "No s'ha puesto cambiar si os tuyos bloqueos se publican",
    "Could not switch your presence on Bluesky" : "No s'ha puesto cambiar a tuya presencia en Bluesky",
    "Copy the Bluesky handle" : "Copiar l'identificador de Bluesky",
    "DID" : "DID",
    "Copy the DID" : "Copiar o DID",
    "Your Bluesky identity is not registered with the directory yet; this server keeps trying. Your profile and posts go to Bluesky once it is." : "A tuya identidat de Bluesky encara no ye rechistrada en o directorio; iste servidor sigue intentando-lo. O tuyo perfil y as tuyas publicacions plegan ta Bluesky quan ye rechistrada.",
    "Be on Bluesky" : "Estar en Bluesky",
    "You are not on Bluesky: your profile and posts are not shown there, and nothing new goes there. Bluesky apps are signed out of your account, and your Bluesky messages and notifications are not read." : "No yes en Bluesky: o tuyo perfil y as tuyas publicacions no s'amuestran allí, y no i va cosa nueva. As aplicacions de Bluesky zarran a sesión d'a tuya cuenta, y os tuyos mensaches y notificacions de Bluesky no se leyen.",
    "You can still follow and read Bluesky accounts here, but your likes, replies and messages to them stay here. Switched back on, your handle, profile and earlier posts are back; posts written while off stay off Bluesky." : "Encara puetz seguir y leyer cuentas de Bluesky aquí, pero os tuyos agrados, respuestas y mensaches ta ellas se quedan aquí. Si lo tornas a activar, o tuyo identificador, o tuyo perfil y as tuyas publicacions anteriors tornan; as publicacions escritas mientres yera desactivau se quedan fuera de Bluesky.",
    "Switched off, your Bluesky profile and posts are no longer shown there and nothing new goes there. Your handle stays yours, and switching back on brings everything back except what you wrote while off." : "Si lo desactivas, o tuyo perfil y as tuyas publicacions de Bluesky ya no s'amuestran allí y no i va cosa nueva. O tuyo identificador sigue estando tuyo, y si lo tornas a activar torna tot, fueras de lo que escribiés mientres yera desactivau.",
    "Publish my blocks of Bluesky accounts" : "Publicar os mios bloqueos de cuentas de Bluesky",
    "Bluesky keeps the accounts you block from replying to you, quoting or mentioning you there. Bluesky blocks are public: anybody can see whom you blocked." : "Bluesky impide que as cuentas que blocas te respondan, te citen u te mencionen allí. Os bloqueos de Bluesky son publicos: qualsiquiera puede veyer a qui has blocau.",
    "Your blocks stay on this server: you do not see those accounts here, but on Bluesky they can still reply to you, quote or mention you. Publishing them stops that, and makes them public, as all Bluesky blocks are." : "Os tuyos bloqueos se quedan en iste servidor: aquí no veyes ixas cuentas, pero en Bluesky encara pueden responder-te, citar-te u mencionar-te. Publicar-los atura isto, y los fa publicos, como totz os bloqueos de Bluesky.",
    "Create a new recovery phrase" : "Creyar una nueva frase de recuperación",
    "Create recovery phrase" : "Creyar frase de recuperación",
    "The phrase you have stops working the moment a new one is made." : "A frase que tiens deixa de funcionar en o momento que se'n fa una nueva.",
    "Twelve words that prove this Bluesky identity is yours even without this server. They are shown once, for you to write down." : "Dotze parolas que preban que ista identidat de Bluesky ye tuya mesmo sin iste servidor. S'amuestran una vegada, ta que las apuntes.",
    "Other Bluesky tools do not read the words themselves: the recovery tool below does, and when they are made you also see the key they stand for, written the way tools such as goat take it. This server's key ranks above it, so for 72 hours the server can undo a change made with the phrase, a move to another server included." : "Atras ferramientas de Bluesky no leyen as parolas mesmas: a ferramienta de recuperación d'abaixo sí, y quan se fan tamién veyes a clau que representan, escrita como la prenen ferramientas como goat. A clau d'iste servidor ye per dencima, asinas que entre 72 horas o servidor puede desfer un cambio feito con a frase, incluyindo un trasllado ta un atro servidor.",
    "Download the recovery tool" : "Descargar a ferramienta de recuperación",
    "One page that moves your Bluesky identifier to another server with your twelve words, in your browser, even when this server is gone. Keep it with your words." : "Una pachina que traslada o tuyo identificador de Bluesky ta un atro servidor con as tuyas dotze parolas, en o tuyo navegador, mesmo quan iste servidor ya no existe. Guarda-la con as tuyas parolas.",
    "Open it here" : "Ubrir-la aquí",
    "Who controls your Bluesky identifier" : "Qui controla o tuyo identificador de Bluesky",
    "These keys can change where your identifier points, the first one ranking highest:" : "Istas claus pueden cambiar ta án s'endreza o tuyo identificador, a primera ye a mas alta:",
    "Download your Bluesky account" : "Descargar a tuya cuenta de Bluesky",
    "Your posts, pictures and the history of your Bluesky identifier, in the files Bluesky tools read, with a guide to moving the account even if this server is gone. The archive from the Migration page holds the same files." : "As tuyas publicacions, imachens y l'historial d'o tuyo identificador de Bluesky, en os fichers que leyen as ferramientas de Bluesky, con una guía ta trasladar a cuenta mesmo si iste servidor ya no existe. O fichero d'a pachina Migración tiene os mesmos fichers.",
    "Open Migration" : "Ubrir Migración",
    "Your own domain as your handle" : "O tuyo propio dominio como identificador",
    "If you own a domain, it can be your Bluesky handle. Your followers stay with you; {assigned} keeps working too." : "Si tiens un dominio, puede estar o tuyo identificador de Bluesky. Os tuyos seguidors se quedan con tu; {assigned} tamién sigue funcionando.",
    "Your handle is {handle}." : "O tuyo identificador ye {handle}.",
    "{handle} no longer names your account. Bluesky shows it as invalid until the DNS record or file is back." : "{handle} ya no nombra a tuya cuenta. Bluesky l'amuestra como no valido dica que o rechistro DNS u o fichero tornen.",
    "Bluesky shows {assigned} as your handle again." : "Bluesky torna a amostrar {assigned} como o tuyo identificador.",
    "Use it again" : "Tornar a usar-lo",
    "Keep my domain" : "Conservar o mío dominio",
    "Use {assigned} again" : "Tornar a usar {assigned}",
    "Domain to use as your handle" : "Dominio que cal usar como identificador",
