    "Hidden: no likes, dislikes, boosts or replies are counted for you — on your posts, on anybody else's, and in your phone apps — and other people's profiles show no follower number. Who liked a post is still there to look at, and so is your own follower count." : "Amagaus: no se contan agrados, desagrados, impulsos ni respuestas ta tu — en as tuyas publicacions, en as d'atros y en as tuyas aplicacions d'o telefono — y os perfils d'atras personas no amuestran o numero de seguidors. Encara puetz veyer qui ha feito agrado a una publicación, y tamién o tuyo propio numero de seguidors.",
