    "Their posts stop appearing in your home timeline. If their account is locked you will have to ask again to follow them." : "As suyas publicacions deixan d'amaneixer en a tuya linia de tiempo d'inicio. Si a suya cuenta ye blocada, habrás de demandar de nuevo seguir-la.",
