    "_Follow one more account and this can look at who they follow._::_Follow {count} more accounts and this can look at who they follow._" : ["Sigue {count} cuenta mas y isto podrá mirar a qui sigue.","Sigue {count} cuentas mas y isto podrá mirar a qui siguen."],
