    "Remove #{tag}" : "Sacar #{tag}",
    "Still learning what you like. Showing posts from hashtags you follow and what's trending here." : "Encara ye aprendendo lo que te fa goyo. S'amuestran publicacions d'etiquetas que sigues y lo que ye en tendencia aquí.",
    "Manage interests" : "Chestionar intereses",
    "Dismiss" : "Descartar",
    "Could not save your choice" : "No s'ha puesto alzar a tuya tría",
    "About For you" : "Sobre Ta tu",
    "Aloha Social now learns which hashtags interest you from how you read, to build your For you feed. This stays on this server and is only visible to you." : "Aloha Social agora aprende qualas etiquetas t'interesan por a forma en que lees, ta construir o tuyo fluxo Ta tu. Isto se queda en iste servidor y nomás tu lo puetz veyer.",
    "Manage" : "Chestionar",
    "Turn off" : "Desactivar",
    "Reset all interests" : "Reiniciar totz os intereses",
    "Could not load your interests" : "No s'han puesto cargar os tuyos intereses",
    "Could not save the languages" : "No s'han puesto alzar os idiomas",
    "Could not add #{tag}" : "No s'ha puesto adhibir #{tag}",
    "Your interests were reset" : "Os tuyos intereses s'han reiniciau",
    "Could not reset your interests" : "No s'han puesto reiniciar os tuyos intereses",
    "Learn from my browsing" : "Aprender d'a mía navegación",
    "Which hashtags you linger on, open, like and skip. It stays on this server and nobody but you sees it." : "En qualas etiquetas te detienes, qualas ubres, te fan goyo y te saltas. Se queda en iste servidor y dengún mas que tu no lo veye.",
    "Pause learning" : "Pausar l'aprendizache",
    "For a day of reading something unusual. For you keeps working with what it knows, and nothing new is learned or forgotten until you switch this back." : "Ta un día de leyer bella cosa diferent. Ta tu sigue funcionando con lo que ya sabe, y no s'aprende ni s'ixuplida cosa nueva dica que lo tornes a activar.",
    "Learning is off, so this list is frozen and For you is hidden. You can still change it, and it is all here when you turn learning back on." : "L'aprendizache ye desactivau, asinas que ista lista ye chelada y Ta tu ye amagau. Encara puetz cambiar-la, y tot ye aquí quan tornes a activar l'aprendizache.",
    "Still learning what you like. Until it knows more, For you also shows hashtags you follow and what is trending here." : "Encara ye aprendendo lo que te fa goyo. Dica que sapa mas, Ta tu tamién amuestra etiquetas que sigues y lo que ye en tendencia aquí.",
    "Hashtag to add to your interests" : "Etiqueta que adhibir a os tuyos intereses",
    "hashtag" : "etiqueta",
    "Add to your interests" : "Adhibir a os tuyos intereses",
    "Known hashtags" : "Etiquetas conoixidas",
    "Hashtags you have been reading that are not quite interests yet. Add one to keep it." : "Etiquetas que has iu leyendo y que encara no son de tot intereses. Adhibe-ne una ta conservar-la.",
    "Add #{tag} to your interests" : "Adhibir #{tag} a os tuyos intereses",
    "Languages in For you" : "Idiomas en Ta tu",
    "All languages" : "Totz os idiomas",
    "Only posts in these languages. None chosen means every language." : "Nomás publicacions en istos idiomas. Si no se'n tría garra, totz os idiomas.",
    "Forgets everything learned, and the hashtags you added, placed and pinned. Hashtags you follow stay followed." : "Ixuplida tot lo aprendiu, y as etiquetas que adhibiés, ordenés y fixés. As etiquetas que sigues se siguen seguindo.",
    "Reset all interests?" : "Reiniciar totz os intereses?",
    "Everything Aloha Social has learned about what you like goes, with the hashtags you added and the order you gave them. It starts learning again from nothing. This cannot be undone." : "Tot lo que Aloha Social ha aprendiu sobre lo que te fa goyo se'n va, con as etiquetas que adhibiés y l'orden que les diés. Torna a aprender dende cero. Isto no se puede desfer.",
    "_Show %n more candidate_::_Show %n more candidates_" : ["Amostrar %n candidata mas","Amostrar %n candidatas mas"],
