    "Nobody has quoted this post." : "Dengún no ha citau ista publicación.",
    "Detach this quote" : "Desvincular ista cita",
    "Detaching tells the other server, which then shows the quote as withdrawn. The post itself is theirs and stays where it is." : "Desvincular-la avisa a l'atro servidor, que allora amuestra a cita como retirada. A publicación mesma ye suya y se queda an ye.",
