    "Saving …" : "Alzando …",
    "Nothing is waiting to be posted. The clock in the composer schedules a post for later." : "No i hai cosa asperando ta publicar-se. O reloch d'o compositor programa una publicación ta mas tarde.",
    "Nothing on this server matches “{term}”. A full handle, like @someone@example.org or @someone.example.com, can find somebody this server has not met yet." : "Cosa d'iste servidor no coincide con “{term}”. Un identificador completo, como @belun@example.org u @belun.example.com, puede trobar a belún que iste servidor encara no conoix.",
    "Nothing on this server matches “{term}”. Searching for a full handle like @user@example.org can find somebody this server has not met yet." : "Cosa en iste servidor no coincide con “{term}”. Buscar un identificador completo como @usuario@example.org puede trobar a belún que iste servidor encara no conoixe.",
    "The search could not be run. Please try again." : "No s'ha puesto fer a busca. Torna-lo a intentar.",
    "Search results for “{term}”" : "Resultaus d'a busca de “{term}”",
