    "People" : "Personas",
    "Hashtags" : "Etiquetas",
    "Play sounds" : "Reproducir sons",
    "Listen" : "Escuitar",
    "A soft tick when you like something, a breath of air when a post goes out, and a two-note chime when a direct message arrives. Off until you turn it on." : "Un clic suau quan bella cosa te fa goyo, un bufo d'aire quan sale una publicación, y una campaneta de dos notas quan plega un mensache directo. Desactivau dica que l'activas.",
    "Vibrate" : "Vibrar",
    "A short tap in the hand on a phone when you like, boost, react or post. Your system setting for less motion turns it off as well." : "Un toque curto en a man en un telefono quan das me fa goyo, impulsas, reaccionas u publicas. A configuración d'o sistema ta menos movimiento tamién lo desactiva.",
    "Start videos with sound" : "Empecipiar os videos con son",
    "Shorts start with their sound on, where the browser allows it; otherwise one tap on the speaker turns it on. Muting one keeps the rest muted until you close the tab." : "Os Shorts empecipian con o son activau, an o navegador lo permite; si no, un toque en l'altavoz l'activa. Si en silencias uno, o resto siguen silenciaus dica que zarres a pestanya.",
    "Whatever this server does" : "Lo que faiga iste servidor",
    "Show it like anything else" : "Amostrar-lo como qualsiquier atra cosa",
    "Cover it, one press away" : "Cubrir-lo, a un toque de distancia",
    "Do not show it; I will open the post" : "No amostrar-lo; ubriré a publicación",
    "Saved. It applies the next time this page loads." : "Alzau. S'aplica a proxima vegada que se cargue ista pachina.",
    "Media marked sensitive" : "Multimedia marcau como sensible",
    "A content warning is a different thing: it is the author saying something about the whole post in their own words, and it always covers its post." : "Una alvertencia de conteniu ye un atra cosa: ye l'autor dicindo bella cosa sobre tota a publicación con as suyas parolas, y siempre cubre a suya publicación.",
    "Details" : "Detalles",
    "This server asked {base}/api/v1/instance and got {status}." : "Iste servidor ha consultau {base}/api/v1/instance y ha obteniu {status}.",
    "This server asked {base}/api/v1/instance and something answered, but not this app — a login page or a catch-all index rather than an instance document." : "Iste servidor ha consultau {base}/api/v1/instance y bella cosa ha respondiu, pero no ista aplicación: una pachina d'inicio de sesión u un indiz chenerico en cuenta d'un documento d'instancia.",
    "This server could not reach {base} at all: the connection was refused, the name did not resolve, or the certificate was not accepted." : "Iste servidor no ha puesto aconseguir {base} de garra manera: a connexión s'ha refusau, o nombre no s'ha resuelto u o certificau no s'ha acceptau.",
    "A Mastodon app is given a domain and builds {example} from it. None of them can be told the {prefix} prefix these routes live under, so adding this server to an app fails at its first request, with nothing in the log to show for it." : "A una aplicación de Mastodon se le da un dominio y construye {example} a partir d'ell. A garra d'ellas se le puede decir o prefixo {prefix} baixo o qual son istas rutas, asinas que adhibir iste servidor a una aplicación falla en a suya primera petición, sin cosa en o rechistro que lo amuestre.",
    "Aloha Social builds every account and post address from {configured}, but this server now reports that it lives at {expected}. Nobody looking for an account here under the address the server advertises will find it." : "Aloha Social construye cada adreza de cuenta y de publicación a partir de {configured}, pero iste servidor agora informa que ye en {expected}. Qui busque aquí una cuenta baixo l'adreza que anuncia o servidor no la trobará.",
    ".well-known/webfinger isn't properly set up!" : ".well-known/webfinger no ye bien configurau!",
    "Aloha Social needs the .well-known automatic discovery to be properly set up. If Nextcloud is not installed in the root of the domain, it is often the case that Nextcloud cannot configure this automatically. To use Aloha Social, the administrator of this Nextcloud instance needs to manually configure the .well-known redirects:" : "Aloha Social amenista que o descubrimiento automatico .well-known sía bien configurau. Si Nextcloud no ye instalau en a radiz d'o dominio, a ormino Nextcloud no puede configurar isto automaticament. Ta usar Aloha Social, l'administrador d'ista instancia de Nextcloud ha de configurar manualment as redireccions .well-known:",
    "Open documentation" : "Ubrir documentación",
    "Mastodon apps cannot connect to this server" : "As aplicacions de Mastodon no se pueden connectar a iste servidor",
    "The web server has to map /api, /oauth and two /.well-known paths onto Aloha Social. It has to do that as an internal proxy and not as a redirect: Nextcloud routes on the address a request arrived at, so a plain rewrite answers 404, and many clients drop their authorization when they follow a redirect. Inside the Apache virtual host that serves Nextcloud:" : "O servidor web ha de mapear /api, /oauth y dos rutas /.well-known ta Aloha Social. Ha de fer-lo como un proxy interno y no como una redirección: Nextcloud enruta seguntes l'adreza a la quala plegó una petición, asinas que una simple reescritura responde 404, y muitos clients pierden a suya autorización quan siguen una redirección. Dentro d'o host virtual d'Apache que sirve Nextcloud:",
    "Whatever the rules proxy to has to serve this Nextcloud itself. A host or port that serves a different document root — one with no virtual host for this domain, say — answers 404 for every proxied request, which looks exactly like having no rules at all. An Apache 404 page names the port it came from, which tells the two apart." : "Lo que fan de proxy as reglas ha de servir iste mesmo Nextcloud. Un host u puerto que sirve un atro directorio radiz (un sin host virtual ta iste dominio, por eixemplo) responde 404 a cada petición pasada por o proxy, lo que pareix exactament como no tener garra regla. Una pachina 404 d'Apache diz o puerto d'o qual viene, y asinas se distinguen os dos casos.",
    "The rules for nginx, what each one is for, and what else changes once requests arrive through a proxy are in the documentation. Nothing else is affected: the web interface and federation with other servers work without any of this." : "As reglas ta nginx, ta qué sirve cadaguna, y qué mas cambia quan as peticions plegan a traviés d'un proxy son en a documentación. No afecta a cosa mas: a interficie web y a federación con atros servidors funcionan sin cosa d'isto.",
    "Aloha Social is set up for a different address than this server" : "Aloha Social ye configurau ta una adreza diferent d'a d'iste servidor",
    "Changing it renames every account and post that already exists here, so Aloha Social will not do it on its own. Either point the server back at the address Aloha Social knows, or reset Aloha Social with \"occ social:reset\" — which deletes everything it holds." : "Cambiar-la renombra cada cuenta y publicación que ya existe aquí, asinas que Aloha Social no lo fará por ell mesmo. U torna a endrezar o servidor ta l'adreza que conoixe Aloha Social, u reinicia Aloha Social con \"occ social:reset\", lo que borra tot lo que tiene.",
    "Keep it on my profile" : "Conservar-lo en o mío perfil",
