    "One address per line. A relay is what carries this server's posts to the Bluesky apps; without one, a post written here is published and seen by nobody." : "Una adreza por linia. Un retransmisor ye lo que leva as publicacions d'iste servidor ta las aplicacions de Bluesky; sin garra, una publicación escrita aquí se publica y no la veye dengún.",
