    "Save the list first; the relays told are the ones saved." : "Alza primero a lista; os retransmisors avisaus son os alzaus.",
    "told" : "avisau",
    "Where the identities are registered. The public directory, unless this is a development setup with one of its own." : "An se rechistran as identidatz. O directorio publico, fueras que ista sía una configuración de desembolique con uno propio.",
    "AppView" : "AppView",
    "Where Bluesky accounts and their posts are read from." : "D'an se leyen as cuentas de Bluesky y as suyas publicacions.",
    "Jetstream" : "Jetstream",
    "Optional. With occ social:atproto:listen running, a Jetstream endpoint brings posts from followed Bluesky accounts within seconds instead of on the next poll." : "Opcional. Con occ social:atproto:listen executando-se, un endpoint de Jetstream porta as publicacions de cuentas de Bluesky seguidas en segundos en cuenta d'en a proxima consulta.",
    "Bluesky's chat service, where direct messages with people on Bluesky are kept: they arrive in Messages here, and a Bluesky app signed in here with an app password that allows them reaches them too. Empty turns direct messages with Bluesky off." : "O servicio de chat de Bluesky, an que se guardan os mensaches directos con personas de Bluesky: plegan a Mensaches aquí, y una aplicación de Bluesky que encete sesión aquí con una clau d'aplicación que los permita tamién los recibe. Si se deixa vuedo, se desactivan os mensaches directos con Bluesky.",
    "Sync ceiling" : "Limite de sincronización",
    "How many AppView requests one polling pass may make. Every followed Bluesky account is asked for new posts in turn; the ceiling bounds what a pass costs." : "Quántas peticions a l'AppView puede fer una pasada de consulta. A cada cuenta de Bluesky seguida se le demandan nuevas publicacions por torna; o limite acota lo que costa una pasada.",
    "Trusted Bluesky apps" : "Aplicacions de Bluesky de confianza",
    "Optional. One client ID per line. When one of these apps asks to sign in, the consent page shows its own name and logo; for any other app it shows only the address it is known by, because an app can call itself anything." : "Opcional. Un ID de client por linia. Quan una d'istas aplicacions demanda dentrar, a pachina de consentimiento amuestra o suyo propio nombre y logo; ta qualsiquier atra aplicación amuestra nomás l'adreza por a quala se conoixe, porque una aplicación se puede clamar como quiera.",
    "Blocked on Bluesky" : "Blocaus en Bluesky",
    "An account by its DID, or a whole data server by its host. Nothing from it is read or stored here, and the people here who followed it stop following it." : "Una cuenta por o suyo DID, u un servidor de datos entero por o suyo host. No se leye ni se guarda aquí cosa d'ell, y as personas d'aquí que lo seguiban deixan de seguir-lo.",
    "Nothing is blocked." : "No i hai cosa blocada.",
