    "Deliveries given up on" : "Entregas abandonadas",
    "Once the reason is fixed, \"occ social:queue:retry --instance HOST\" puts them back in the queue." : "Una vegada arreglada a causa, \"occ social:queue:retry --instance HOST\" las torna a meter en a cola.",
