    "_%n delivery was given up on: that server never got it._::_%n deliveries were given up on: those servers never got them._" : ["S'ha abandonau %n entrega: ixe servidor no la recibió nunca.","S'han abandonau %n entregas: ixos servidors no las recibioron nunca."],
    "_Counted over the last %n day, which is how long a finished delivery is kept._::_Counted over the last %n days, which is how long a finished delivery is kept._" : ["Contau en o zaguer %n día, que ye o tiempo que se guarda una entrega rematada.","Contau en os zaguers %n días, que ye o tiempo que se guarda una entrega rematada."],
    "Half-life (days)" : "Meya vida (días)",
    "How fast an interest fades when it is no longer read. After this many days a score is worth half." : "Cómo de rapido s'esmorteix un interés quan ya no se leye. Dimpués de tantos días una puntuación vale a metat.",
    "Listing threshold" : "Branquil de listau",
    "The score a learned hashtag needs before it counts as an interest. Lower learns faster and guesses more." : "A puntuación que amenista una etiqueta aprendida antes de contar como interés. Mas baixa aprende mas rapido y endevina mas.",
    "Interests per person" : "Intereses por persona",
    "The most hashtags one person's list holds." : "O maximo d'etiquetas que contiene a lista d'una persona.",
    "Feed window (days)" : "Finestra d'o fluxo (días)",
    "How far back the feed looks for posts. Longer finds more for rare interests and costs more to rank." : "Quán enta zaga mira o fluxo ta buscar publicacions. Mas larga troba mas ta intereses raros y costa mas d'ordenar.",
    "A whole number from {min} to {max}" : "Un numero entero de {min} a {max}",
    "A number from {min} to {max}" : "Un numero de {min} a {max}",
    "Could not save the For you settings" : "No s'ha puesto alzar a configuración de Ta tu",
    "Enable For you" : "Activar Ta tu",
    "Off hides the feed and the settings, and nothing is learned. What was learned is kept, so turning it back on brings everybody's interests back." : "Desactivau amaga o fluxo y a configuración, y no s'aprende cosa. Lo aprendiu se conserva, asinas que activar-lo de nuevo torna os intereses de totz.",
    "Learn from browsing unless a user turns it off" : "Aprender d'a navegación fueras que un usuario lo desactive",
    "The GDPR-relevant choice: off makes learning opt-in, and each person is invited to turn it on. A user's own choice always wins." : "A opción relevant ta o RGPD: desactivau fa que l'aprendizache sía opcional, y se convida a cada persona a activar-lo. A tría propia d'un usuario siempre gana.",
    "Could not load the refused files" : "No s'han puesto cargar os fichers refusaus",
