    "Refuse this file" : "Refusar iste fichero",
    "The checksum of a file is what sha256sum prints for it. It matches that exact file: a re-encoded or re-cropped copy is a different file and is not caught." : "A suma de comprebación d'un fichero ye lo que imprime sha256sum ta ell. Coincide con ixe fichero exacto: una copia recodificada u retallada ye un atro fichero y no se detecta.",
