    "What is shared is public posts and nothing else: a followers-only post has an audience that was chosen, and a relay is the opposite of a chosen audience. Nothing a person on this server writes privately ever reaches one." : "Lo que se comparte son publicacions publicas y cosa mas: una publicación nomás ta seguidors tiene una audiencia triada, y un retransmisor ye lo contrario d'una audiencia triada. Cosa que una persona d'iste servidor escriba de forma privada no en aconsigue nunca garra.",
