    "Packs" : "Paquetz",
    "Pictures" : "Imachens",
    "Tags" : "Etiquetas",
    "Could not open this pack. The server may be busy." : "No s'ha puesto ubrir iste paquet. O servidor puede estar ocupau.",
    "What to discover" : "Qué descubrir",
    "Nothing to discover yet" : "Encara no i hai cosa que descubrir",
    "All starter packs" : "Totz os paquetz d'inicio",
    "Their server did not answer. Often it is only busy for a moment. If this Nextcloud cannot be reached from the internet, some servers never answer it." : "O suyo servidor no ha respondiu. Muitas vegadas nomás ye ocupau un momento. Si no se puede acceder a iste Nextcloud dende internet, bells servidors nunca no le responden.",
    "No starter packs" : "No i hai paquetz d'inicio",
    "Your island and its neighbours" : "A tuya isla y as suyas vecinas",
    "Every server in the fediverse is an island. Following somebody on another one opens a canoe route to it, and their posts travel to you along that route." : "Cada servidor d'o fediverso ye una isla. Seguir a belún en un atra ubre una ruta en canoa ta ella, y as suyas publicacions viachan ta tu por ixa ruta.",
    "Search the fediverse" : "Buscar en o fediverso",
    "Names and handles in public directories, including people on servers this one has never met. Somebody who is not listed is found by their full handle, like @someone@example.org or @someone.example.com, in the search at the top of the sidebar." : "Nombres y identificadors en directorios publicos, incluyindo personas en servidors que iste nunca no ha conoixiu. Belún que no ye listau se troba por o suyo identificador completo, como @belun@example.org u @belun.example.com, en a busqueda d'o cabo d'alto d'a barra lateral.",
    "Names and handles in public directories, including people on servers this one has never met. Somebody who is not listed is found by their full handle, like @someone@example.org, in the search at the top of the sidebar." : "Nombres y identificadors en directorios publicos, incluyindo personas en servidors que iste nunca no ha conoixiu. Belún que no ye listau se troba por o suyo identificador completo, como @belun@example.org, en a busqueda d'o cabo d'alto d'a barra lateral.",
    "Because of who you follow" : "Por a chent que sigues",
    "The people you follow follow other people. This asks their servers who, and puts the ones several of them share first." : "As personas que sigues siguen a atras personas. Isto demanda a os suyos servidors a qui, y mete primero os que comparten quantos d'ells.",
    "Suggested on Bluesky" : "Sucheriu en Bluesky",
    "People Bluesky suggests to you, from who you follow there. Follow them here like anybody else." : "Personas que Bluesky te suchiere, seguntes a qui sigues allí. Sigue-las aquí como a qualsiquiera atra.",
    "People this server knows" : "Personas que conoixe iste servidor",
