    "On your Nextcloud" : "En o tuyo Nextcloud",
    "Nobody here yet" : "Encara no i hai dengún aquí",
    "Accounts this server has met will appear here. Until it has met any, the search above asks other servers’ directories instead." : "As cuentas que iste servidor ha conoixiu amaneixerán aquí. Dica que no en conoixca garra, a busca d'alto consulta os directorios d'atros servidors.",
    "Failed to load follow requests" : "No s'han puesto cargar as solicitutz de seguimiento",
