    "Who can find and follow you" : "Qui te puede trobar y seguir",
    "How others find you, and who sees what you post." : "Cómo te troban atros, y qui veye lo que publicas.",
    "A message from anybody else does not notify you, and waits among your requests." : "Un mensache de qualsequier atra persona no te notifica cosa, y aguarda entre as tuyas solicitutz.",
    "Featured hashtags" : "Etiquetas destacadas",
    "Hashtags shown under your bio. Anyone can click one to read what you posted with it." : "Etiquetas amostradas debaixo d'a tuya biografía. Qualsiquiera puede fer clic en una ta leyer lo que has publicau con ella.",
    "Portfolio" : "Portafolio",
    "A public page with the photos you choose and its own address, for a CV or a website. Only public photos can be on it." : "Una pachina publica con as fotos que tríes y a suya propia adreza, ta un CV u un puesto web. Nomás i pueden estar fotos publicas.",
    "The hashtags your For you feed is made of, learned from what you read. Only you see this." : "As etiquetas que forman o tuyo fluxo Ta tu, aprendidas de lo que lees. Nomás tu veyes isto.",
    "A list is a few of the people you follow, read as a timeline of its own. Your lists are in the sidebar." : "Una lista son bellas d'as personas que sigues, leyidas como una linia de tiempo propia. As tuyas listas son en a barra lateral.",
    "Custom feeds and lists from Bluesky, read here as timelines of their own. A Bluesky app signed in to this account keeps the same ones." : "Fluxos personalizaus y listas de Bluesky, leyius aquí como linias de tiempo propias. Una aplicación de Bluesky que ha dentrau en ista cuenta conserva os mesmos.",
    "How pictures and videos their author marked sensitive are shown to you." : "Cómo se te amuestran as imachens y videos que o suyo autor ha marcau como sensibles.",
    "Likes and followers" : "Me fa goyo y seguidors",
    "Whether you see how many likes, boosts, replies and followers posts and people have. Off unless you turn it on." : "Si veyes quántos me fa goyo, impulsos, respuestas y seguidors tienen as publicacions y as personas. Desactivau fueras que l'actives.",
    "Looking back" : "Mirando enta zaga",
    "A short note about your week at the top of your feed, next to your posts from this day in earlier years." : "Una nota curta sobre a tuya semana en o cabo d'alto d'o tuyo fluxo, chunto a las tuyas publicacions de tal día como hue en anyos anteriors.",
    "Sound and touch" : "Son y tacto",
    "Small confirmations you hear or feel. They are kept on this device only, so a laptop at work can stay quiet while your phone taps back." : "Chicotas confirmacions que sientes u notas. Se guardan nomás en iste dispositivo, asinas que un portatil en o treballo puede quedar-se en silencio mientres o tuyo telefono te fa un toque.",
    "Right away or in a digest, and the hours to stay quiet." : "De seguida u en un resumen, y as horas de silencio.",
    "Whose posts, likes and follows reach you right away, and whose wait for you to look." : "As publicacions, me fa goyo y seguimientos de qui te plegan de seguida, y os de qui asperan que mires.",
    "Scheduled posts" : "Publicacions programadas",
    "What you have written to be published later. Move one to another time or cancel it here." : "Lo que has escrito ta publicar-se mas tarde. Mueve-ne una a un atra hora u cancela-la aquí.",
    "Waiting for review" : "Asperando revisión",
    "Posts a moderator looks at before they go out, such as the first post of a new account. You can take one back." : "Publicacions que un moderador revisa antes que salgan, como a primera publicación d'una cuenta nueva. Puetz retirar-ne una.",
    "Archived posts" : "Publicacions archivadas",
    "Posts you put away. They are off your profile and your timelines here, but not deleted on other servers. Put one back any time." : "Publicacions que has guardau. Ya no son en o tuyo perfil ni en as tuyas linias de tiempo aquí, pero no se borran en atros servidors. Torna a meter-ne una quan quieras.",
    "Replies in Files" : "Respuestas en Fichers",
    "A picture you post from Files keeps a link to its file. Replies to the post can be read in the file's Comments tab, next to the picture they are about." : "Una imachen que publicas dende Fichers conserva un vinclo a o suyo fichero. As respuestas a la publicación se pueden leyer en a pestanya Comentarios d'o fichero, chunto a la imachen a la quala se refieren.",
    "Authorized apps" : "Aplicacions autorizadas",
    "Apps signed in to your account, such as a phone client. Sign out the ones you no longer use, or all of them after losing a phone." : "Aplicacions que han dentrau en a tuya cuenta, como un client d'o telefono. Zarra a sesión d'as que ya no uses, u de totas dimpués de perder un telefono.",
    "This account is also reachable on Bluesky, because this server offers one." : "Ista cuenta tamién ye accesible en Bluesky, porque iste servidor ofreix una.",
    "Invite people" : "Convidar a personas",
    "A link somebody without an account can use to register on this server. Each link works once and for a week." : "Un vinclo que belún sin cuenta puede usar ta rechistrar-se en iste servidor. Cada vinclo funciona una vegada y mientres una semana.",
    "Your storage" : "O tuyo almagazenamiento",
    "The pictures and videos you uploaded here, against what this server lets each account keep. Media from other servers does not count." : "As imachens y videos que has puyau aquí, en comparanza con lo que iste servidor deixa guardar a cada cuenta. O multimedia d'atros servidors no conta.",
    "Delete your Aloha Social account" : "Borrar a tuya cuenta d'Aloha Social",
    "Your account on this server and everything you posted. This cannot be undone." : "A tuya cuenta en iste servidor y tot lo que has publicau. Isto no se puede desfer.",
    "Your fediverse account and everything you posted. Your Nextcloud account stays as it is. This cannot be undone." : "A tuya cuenta d'o fediverso y tot lo que has publicau. A tuya cuenta de Nextcloud se queda como ye. Isto no se puede desfer.",
    "Introduction" : "Introducción",
    "The four steps shown when your account was new: your address, people to follow, and the follows you had on another server." : "Os cuatro pasos que s'amostroron quan a tuya cuenta yera nueva: a tuya adreza, personas que seguir, y os seguimientos que tenebas en un atro servidor.",
    "The keys this app listens for while you are reading, and the switch that turns them off." : "As teclas que ista aplicación escuita mientres lees, y l'interruptor que las desactiva.",
    "Profile and privacy" : "Perfil y privacidat",
    "Who can find you, follow you and see your posts." : "Qui te puede trobar, seguir y veyer as tuyas publicacions.",
