    "Apps and account" : "Aplicacions y cuenta",
    "Apps signed in as you, invitations, and deleting the account." : "Aplicacions que han dentrau como tu, invitacions, y borrar a cuenta.",
    "Help" : "Aduya",
    "The introduction again, and the keyboard shortcuts." : "A introducción de nuevo, y os alcorces de teclau.",
    "Changes are saved as you make them." : "Os cambios s'alzan a mesura que los fas.",
    "Settings groups" : "Grupos de configuración",
    "Check your email" : "Compreba o tuyo correu",
    "Thank you" : "Gracias",
    "You were invited to join {domain}. Your account can be used for Aloha Social, and nothing else on this server." : "T'han convidau a chunir-te a {domain}. A tuya cuenta se puede usar ta Aloha Social, y ta cosa mas en iste servidor.",
    "Join {domain}. Your account can be used for Aloha Social, and nothing else on this server. An administrator looks at every registration before it becomes an account." : "Chune-te a {domain}. A tuya cuenta se puede usar ta Aloha Social, y ta cosa mas en iste servidor. Un administrador revisa cada rechistro antes que se faiga una cuenta.",
    "Join {domain}. Your account can be used for Aloha Social, and nothing else on this server." : "Chune-te a {domain}. A tuya cuenta se puede usar ta Aloha Social, y ta cosa mas en iste servidor.",
