    "Your address will look like @{username}@{domain}. You can follow and talk with people on Mastodon, Pixelfed, PeerTube and more." : "A tuya adreza será como @{username}@{domain}. Puetz seguir y charrar con chent de Mastodon, Pixelfed, PeerTube y mas.",
    "Your address will be {address}, and {bluesky} on Bluesky" : "A tuya adreza será {address}, y {bluesky} en Bluesky",
    "Your address will be {address}" : "A tuya adreza será {address}",
    "your email address" : "a tuya adreza de correu electronico",
    "We sent a link to {email}. Follow it within 24 hours to confirm your address." : "Hemos ninviau un vinclo a {email}. Sigue-lo en 24 horas ta confirmar a tuya adreza.",
    "Your registration is waiting for an administrator. You get an email once it has been looked at." : "O tuyo rechistro aspera a un administrador. Recibirás un correu quan s'haiga revisau.",
    "Log in as {handle} with the password you chose." : "Dentra como {handle} con a clau que triés.",
