    "Accounts in the fediverse from {from} to {to}" : "Cuentas en o fediverso de {from} a {to}",
    "Counted separately from the figures above — the two surveys crawl different servers and count dormant accounts differently, so their totals do not match. Month by month, by" : "Contau por separau d'as cifras d'alto: as dos enquestas rastrean servidors diferents y cuentan de forma diferent as cuentas inactivas, asinas que os suyos totals no coinciden. Mes a mes, por",
    "{counted} of {max} — as far back as this page goes" : "{counted} de {max}: dica an plega ista pachina",
    "_{counted} post, all of them_::_{counted} posts, all of them_" : ["{counted} publicación, a unica","{counted} publicacions, totas"],
    "Estimated reach" : "Aconseguimiento estimau",
    "Sum of the per-post estimates" : "Suma d'as estimacions por publicación",
    "Interactions" : "Interaccions",
    "Likes, boosts and replies together" : "Me fa goyo, impulsos y respuestas chuntos",
    "As far as this server was told" : "Seguntes lo que se le dició a iste servidor",
    "Boosts" : "Impulsos",
    "{label}: {now} over the last {days} days, against {before} over the {days} before them." : "{label}: {now} en os zaguers {days} días, en comparanza con {before} en os {days} anteriors.",
    "Reach is an estimate: your followers today, plus the followers of everybody who boosted the post. Audiences that overlap are counted twice, and nobody can count the people who saw a post without touching it." : "L'aconseguimiento ye una estimación: os tuyos seguidors de hue, mas os seguidors de totz os que impulsoron a publicación. As audiencias que se superposan se cuentan dos vegadas, y dengún no puede contar as personas que veyeron una publicación sin tocar-la.",
    "_The audience of one account that boosted you is not known here, and counts as nobody._::_The audiences of {count} accounts that boosted you are not known here, and count as nobody._" : ["L'audiencia de {count} cuenta que t'impulsó no se conoixe aquí, y no conta como dengún.","As audiencias de {count} cuentas que t'impulsoron no se conoixen aquí, y no cuentan como dengún."],
    "The {listed} most recent of the {posts} posts in the window." : "As {listed} mas recients d'as {posts} publicacions d'o periodo.",
    "_The one post of the window._::_All {posts} posts of the window._" : ["A unica publicación ({posts}) d'o periodo.","Totas as {posts} publicacions d'o periodo."],
