    "_%n post at {hour}:00 UTC_::_%n posts at {hour}:00 UTC_" : ["%n publicación a las {hour}:00 UTC","%n publicacions a las {hour}:00 UTC"],
    "What you have posted here, and what came back. Counted from this server when you opened the page, so it is never a stale number." : "Lo que has publicau aquí, y lo que n'ha tornau. Contau dende iste servidor quan has ubierto a pachina, asinas que nunca ye un numero antiguo.",
