    "Now" : "Agora",
    "Before" : "Antes",
    "Both windows are the same length, so the pair is worth reading. A post counts on the day it went out, together with everything it has collected since." : "As dos periodos tienen a mesma largaria, asinas que vale a pena leyer a parella. Una publicación conta en o día que salió, chunto con tot lo que ha replegau dende allora.",
    "Previous total" : "Total anterior",
    "Post breakdown" : "Desglose d'as publicacions",
    "Individual posts" : "Publicacions individuals",
    "Engagement" : "Interacción",
    "How your posts are doing" : "Cómo van as tuyas publicacions",
    "likes received" : "me fa goyo recibius",
    "{n} per post" : "{n} por publicación",
    "boosts received" : "impulsos recibius",
    "replies received" : "respuestas recibidas",
    "quotes received" : "citas recibidas",
    "engagement per post" : "interacción por publicación",
