    "{n}× the median" : "{n}× a mediana",
    "got no answer" : "no han recibiu respuesta",
    "A floor rather than a total: a like on a server that never told this one about it cannot be counted anywhere. There are no impressions to divide by either, so the rate is against your follower count." : "Un minimo y no un total: un me fa goyo en un servidor que nunca no l'ha comunicau a iste no se puede contar en garra puesto. Tampoco no i hai impresions por as qualas dividir, asinas que a taxa ye respecto a o tuyo numero de seguidors.",
    "What works" : "Qué funciona",
    "Average engagement per post, by what the post was." : "Interacción meya por publicación, seguntes qué yera a publicación.",
    "When your posts do best" : "Quán funcionan millor as tuyas publicacions",
    "Not enough posts at any one hour to say yet — it takes three in the same hour before this is more than luck." : "Encara no i hai prou publicacions a garra hora ta decir-lo: amenista tres en a mesma hora antes que isto sía mas que suerte.",
