    "Where the engagement comes from" : "D'án viene a interacción",
    "Likes, boosts and replies, by the server of whoever made them. {n}% came from accounts on this server." : "Me fa goyo, impulsos y respuestas, por o servidor de qui los ha feito. O {n}% ha plegau de cuentas d'iste servidor.",
    "The network you are posting into" : "O ret en o qual publicas",
    "servers this one talks to" : "servidors con os quals charra iste",
    "servers in the fediverse" : "servidors en o fediverso",
