    "What the fediverse runs on" : "Sobre qué funciona o fediverso",
    "How the fediverse has grown" : "Cómo ha creixiu o fediverso",
    "Accounts, month by month" : "Cuentas, mes a mes",
    "A step in this line is usually the survey reaching servers it had not reached before, rather than the network changing size — so no year-on-year figure is shown for a year that has one in it." : "Un salto en ista linia normalment ye l'enquesta plegando a servidors que no heba aconseguiu antes, y no o ret cambiando de grandaria; asinas que no s'amuestra garra cifra interanual ta un anyo que en tienga uno.",
    "What you did" : "Lo que has feito",
    "Everything above counts what came back to you. This counts what you did: a quiet month here is a month you did not post, not a month nobody answered." : "Tot lo d'alto conta lo que t'ha tornau. Isto conta lo que has feito tu: un mes tranquilo aquí ye un mes que no publiqués, no un mes que no te respondió dengún.",
    "How steadily you post" : "Con quánta regularidat publicas",
    "days you posted on" : "días que has publicau",
    "{n}% of the days counted" : "{n}% d'os días contaus",
    "longest run of days" : "racha mas larga de días",
    "longest quiet spell" : "periodo de silencio mas largo",
    "Who you talk with" : "Con qui charras",
    "From the replies rather than from who you follow. The two are rarely the same list." : "A partir d'as respuestas y no de qui sigues. As dos listas rarament son a mesma.",
    "not followed" : "no seguiu",
    "{n}% of the people who replied to you are people you do not follow." : "O {n}% d'as personas que t'han respondiu son personas que no sigues.",
    "Your pictures" : "As tuyas imachens",
    "carry a description" : "levan descripción",
    "{done} of {all}" : "{done} de {all}",
    "A picture without a description is a picture nobody using a screen reader can read. This is the one number on the page you can move on your own." : "Una imachen sin descripción ye una imachen que dengún que use un lector de pantalla no puede leyer. Iste ye l'unico numero d'a pachina que puetz mover tu solo.",
    "What you write, and what you point at" : "Lo que escribes, y enta án apuntas",
