    "Which posts to show" : "Qualas publicacions amostrar",
    "You can now choose who reaches your notifications — new accounts and people you don't follow can wait for your review." : "Agora puetz triar qui plega a las tuyas notificacions: as cuentas nuevas y as personas que no sigues pueden asperar a la tuya revisión.",
