    "Lemon" : "Limón",
    "Your Aloha Social account has been deleted" : "S'ha borrau a tuya cuenta d'Aloha Social",
    "The Aloha Social account and the Nextcloud account created for it have been deleted. You are now signed out." : "S'han borrau a cuenta d'Aloha Social y a cuenta de Nextcloud creyada ta ella. Agora has zarrau a sesión.",
    "Aloha Social sent requests to remove your posts to the servers that received them. Those servers control copies they may already have stored." : "Aloha Social ha ninviau peticions ta sacar as tuyas publicacions a os servidors que las recibioron. Ixos servidors controlan as copias que ya puedan haber guardau.",
    "Return to Aloha Social" : "Tornar ta Aloha Social",
